% it explicitly. Ferrer et al. find the OPPOSITE VALENCE for the confidence channel: they
% report that self-reported confidence calibrates BEST and recommend simply asking the model
% to state its confidence. That is not a contradiction of our result -- but only if the text
% says precisely WHICH object we indict. We do not indict the scalar confidence as a ranking
